{"version":1,"content":"<p>台灣金曲歌后彭佳慧日前於高雄巨蛋舉辦《數着時間的日子》巡演，特別請來另一位金曲歌后A-Lin擔任神秘嘉賓，彭佳慧笑着對A-Lin說：「你知道嗎？</p><p>你一出來，大家都醒了！</p><p>今天最大的驚喜，就是能把這麼忙的A-Lin請到高雄來，真的非常謝謝你！</p><p>」&amp;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T18:18:58.823982+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":123,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T18:01:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T18:12:11.591250+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T18:12:11.591250+00:00","content_hash":"6d9010e1667ab0629b05a4fcdec553719a028af09466ce3ab0d98ed2c921cd1b","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}